                            id: 'snrProd', label: '几种真实日程的 log SNR（横轴 = t/T）', sub: '绿 = cosine · 紫虚 = linear（DDPM）· 橙 = scaled linear（Stable Diffusion）· 蓝 = rectified flow（SNR = (1−t)²/t²）', large: true, size: [360, 230],
